---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 | 帆哥" description="不会写代码的售前，用 AI Agent 把想法变成产品">
  <div class="about-page">

    <!-- ════════════════ 1. Hero ════════════════ -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="hero-accent"></div>
      <div class="hero-avatar-row">
        <img src="/images/avatar-cartoon.jpeg" alt="帆哥" class="hero-avatar" />
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1>关于帆哥</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            <strong>不会写代码的售前</strong>，在 B2B SaaS 行业摸爬滚打十几年。
            从给客户讲方案、做 Demo、搭渠道体系，到用 AI Agent 把一个个想法变成能用的产品——
            代码不再是工程师的特权，而是每个想解决问题的业务人的工具。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 2. 我的故事 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card story-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">📖</span> 我的故事</h2>
      <div class="story-body">
        <p>
          在 B2B SaaS 和互联网行业<strong>做了十几年</strong>，最熟悉的事是给客户讲方案、做 Demo、搭渠道体系、陪销售打单。
          见过太多企业数字化转型喊口号落不了地，也见过太多好工具因为"不会用"被束之高阁。
        </p>
        <p>
          2025 年 AI coding agent 爆发后，我开始用自然语言"写代码"——不是写 <code>class</code> 和 <code>function</code>，
          而是描述我想要什么，让 AI 帮我实现。从搭建这个个人主页，到做自媒体自动化流水线，到构建一套可复用的 AI 工作流技能包——
          全部由 AI 代笔，我来指挥。
        </p>
        <p class="story-thesis">
          我的核心命题：<strong>一个不懂编程的业务人，能不能靠 AI Agent 构建自己的数字产品？</strong>
          答案是可以。而且不止是我可以，你也可以。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 3. 一句话 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card quote-card">
      <blockquote>
        "我不做'技术产品'，我做的是用技术解决业务问题的方案。面向的是那些想用 AI 提升效率、但又不想从零学编程的销售、售前和运营。"
        <cite>—— 帆哥</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 4. 找到我 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card social-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">📡</span> 找到我</h2>
      <p class="social-intro">扫码关注 / 加群，一起聊 AI、聊搞钱、聊用 Agent 干活</p>

      <div class="qr-grid">
        <a class="qr-card" href="#" onclick="return false;">
          <div class="qr-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-feishu-group.png" alt="飞书AI粉丝群" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="qr-label">
            <strong>飞书 AI 粉丝群</strong>
            <span>帆友科技 · 帆哥AI粉丝群</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="qr-card" href="#" onclick="return false;">
          <div class="qr-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-wechat-mp.jpg" alt="帆哥AI研究室" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="qr-label">
            <strong>微信公众号</strong>
            <span>帆哥AI研究室</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="qr-card" href="#" onclick="return false;">
          <div class="qr-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-video-account.jpg" alt="视频号" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="qr-label">
            <strong>视频号</strong>
            <span>帆哥AI研究室</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="qr-card" href="#" onclick="return false;">
          <div class="qr-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-douyin.png" alt="抖音" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="qr-label">
            <strong>抖音</strong>
            <span>帆哥 Benjamin@AI研究社</span>
          </div>
          <div class="douyin-id">抖音号：<strong>584401655</strong></div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="social-links-row">
        <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/13472754" target="_blank" rel="noopener">B站 · 帆哥Benjamin_AI研究院</a>
        <a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c2b8221000000000701bb2d" target="_blank" rel="noopener">小红书 · 帆哥Benjamin_AI研究院</a>
        <a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/fanshuai001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">知乎 · 帆哥AI研究院</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/wangan0214" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub · wangan0214</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 5. 我正在做的事 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card work-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">🚀</span> 我正在做的事</h2>
      <ul class="work-list">
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">🎬</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>自媒体自动化流水线</strong>
            <span>OBS 录制口播 → AI 转录截图 → 一键发布微信公众号，一个人完成一个团队的工作</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">🤖</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>AI Builder 开发者</strong>
            <span>围绕内容生产、数据分析、客户沟通搭建了一批可复用的 AI 工作流与智能体</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">💼</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>售前 × AI 效率工具</strong>
            <span>用 AI Agent 做方案自动生成、竞品对比、招标分析</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">☁️</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>飞书 × AI 深度集成</strong>
            <span>把 AI 能力嵌入日常工作流：审批、报表、客户管理</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 6. 精选项目 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card projects-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">💎</span> 精选项目</h2>
      <p class="projects-intro">我在做的和沉淀下来的东西，点进去看看</p>
      <div class="projects-grid">

        <a href="https://github.com/wangan0214" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">🐙</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>GitHub 主页</strong>
            <span>wangan0214 · 开源项目与代码仓库</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://wangan0214.feishu.cn/wiki/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">📚</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>飞书知识库</strong>
            <span>AI 知识体系 · 方法论沉淀 · 搞钱集中营</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://fangeai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">🏠</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>本站 fangeai.com</strong>
            <span>Astro 静态站 · Cloudflare Pages · 免备案</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/rss.xml" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">📡</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>RSS 订阅</strong>
            <span>文章更新通知 · 可接入任何阅读器</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 7. AI 工具箱 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card toolkit-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">🛠</span> 我的 AI 工具箱</h2>
      <p class="toolkit-intro">每天实际在用的生产力栈，不是"听说好用"，是真·手上有泥</p>

      <!-- 分类 1: 对话 & 深度思考 -->
      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">对话 & 深度思考</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured"><strong>Claude</strong><span>深度推理、长文写作、方案架构——主力"第二大脑"</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>ChatGPT</strong><span>GPT-4o 多模态 · 创意发散 · 头脑风暴首选</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>DeepSeek</strong><span>中文语境强 · 代码能力强 · 性价比极高</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>Kimi</strong><span>20万+ token 超长上下文 · 整份 PDF 丢进去分析</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>豆包 Doubao</strong><span>字节系 · 中文理解优秀 · 响应快</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>MiniMax M3</strong><span>国产大模型 · 多模型对比参考选手</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 分类 2: 编码 & 自动化 -->
      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">编码 & 自动化</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured"><strong>WorkBuddy</strong><span>核心工作台 · AI Agent 平台 · 内置文件/浏览器/终端/GitHub 连接器</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item featured"><strong>Codex</strong><span>OpenAI 编程引擎 · 自然语言生成完整项目 · 全栈开发</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>Codex++</strong><span>Codex 增强封装 · 结构化工作流模板</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>Cursor / CC Switch</strong><span>AI 原生 IDE · 代码补全+编辑+重构一体化</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>Docker</strong><span>容器化部署 · 一键启动 AI 工具服务端环境</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>ZCode</strong><span>轻量级代码编辑运行环境</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 分类 3: 智能体 & 工作流 -->
      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">智能体 & 工作流</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured"><strong>扣子 Coze</strong><span>字节智能体平台 · 可视化拖拽 ChatBot · 接入飞书/微信/抖音</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><strong>skills-manager</strong><span>Skill 管理工具 · 创建编辑发布可复用 AI 技能包</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 分类 4: 内容生产 -->
      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">内容生产</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured"><strong>AI-Media2Doc</strong><span>口播视频 → 公众号图文一键转换 · OBS 录制→AI转录→自动排版</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 订阅 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="subscribe-bar">
      <p>不想错过更新？<a href="/rss.xml">订阅 RSS Feed</a> 或上方扫码关注公众号</p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page { max-width: 100%; }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .about-hero { padding: 0.5rem 0 2.5rem; }
  .hero-accent {
    width: 60px; height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--accent), transparent);
    margin: 0 auto 1.8rem; border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .hero-avatar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-avatar {
    width: 100px; height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(184,74,60,0.20);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .hero-avatar:hover { transform: scale(1.06); }
  .hero-text { text-align: left; }
  .hero-text h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: var(--fs-h1); }
  .lead {
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* ── 统一 Card ── */
  .card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 2.5rem 2.8rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.045);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }

  /* Section 标题统一样式 */
  h2.section-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  h2.section-icon .icon {
    font-size: 1.3em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .card > p,
  .card .intro-text {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── 2. 故事卡 ── */
  .story-card .story-body p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }
  .story-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .story-thesis {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-soft), transparent);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    margin-top: 1.2rem !important;
  }
  .story-thesis strong { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── 3. 语录卡 ── */
  .quote-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf7f2, var(--bg-card)); }
  .quote-card blockquote {
    border: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .quote-card cite {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* ── 4. 社交卡 ── */
  .social-card { text-align: center; }
  .social-intro {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .qr-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .qr-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid #ede8dc;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .qr-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.09);
  }
  .qr-img-wrap {
    width: 150px; height: 150px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f8f6f1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid #e8e2d4;
  }
  .qr-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  .qr-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .qr-label strong {
    font-family: var(--serif-head);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .qr-label span { font-size: var(--fs-xs); color: var(--text-light); }
  .douyin-id {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .douyin-id strong { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .social-links-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.2rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--rule);
  }
  .social-links-row a {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
  }
  .social-links-row a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── 5. 正在做的事 ── */
  .work-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
  }
  .work-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ebe1;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .work-list li:hover { background: rgba(184,74,60,0.03); }
  .work-list li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid #f0ebe1; }
  .work-emoji { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 0.15rem; }
  .work-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }
  .work-text strong {
    font-family: var(--serif-head);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .work-text span {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* ── 6. 精选项目 ── */
  .projects-intro {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin: -1rem 0 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .project-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #ede8dc;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .project-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .project-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .project-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .project-info strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--serif-head);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .project-info span {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .project-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--rule);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .project-card:hover .project-arrow { color: var(--accent); transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* ── 7. AI 工具箱 ── */
  .toolkit-intro {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .tool-group { margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .tool-group:first-of-type { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .tool-group-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .tool-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .tool-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.015);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border-left: 3px solid #ddd;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .tool-item:hover {
    transform: translateX(3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
